            <sourceDesc>
                <p>Born digital. Shared authority file: the classification categories referred to
                    by the corpus files.</p>
            </sourceDesc>
        </fileDesc>
        <encodingDesc>
            <projectDesc>
                <p>This file holds the taxonomies shared by all the inscription files of the
                    corpus. An inscription points to a category by its identifier, in the form
                    <code>ana="../vocabularies/taxonomy.xml#centenarius"</code>. Category
                    identifiers are in Latin wherever the scholarly tradition supplies a received
                    term; translations and definitions are carried by the children of
                    <gi>catDesc</gi> and may be in any number of languages.</p>
                <p>Classes are declared here, individual entities are not. A particular
                    organization, person or place is recorded in the relevant authority list and
                    points from there to its class in this file.</p>
            </projectDesc>
