                    <category xml:id="senator-military">
                        <catDesc>
                            <term xml:lang="la">senator</term>
                            <gloss xml:lang="en">Late Roman military rank, superior to ducenarius; attested in scholae, fabricenses, and infantry units. Originally granted to ducenarii of agentes in rebus from 390 CE; the transfer of the senatorial title to military context remains unclear.</gloss>
